From: Aishwarya R <aishwarya.r@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 10:54:53 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] DSCP: Building and sending Unsolicited DSCP policy request

Add support to construct and transmit unsolicited DSCP Policy Request
frames to connected STAs. This includes:

Construction of a QoS Policy element for a given DSCP policy, including
QoS management attributes like classifier, domain name, and port range.

Building and sending one or more DSCP Policy Request frames to a STA,
handling fragmentation if the total size exceeds the maximum allowed.

Batching multiple policies and setting the More bit when additional
frames are needed.

Backport of hostap commit 241f79bbcf75.

Signed-off-by: Aishwarya R <aishwarya.r@oss.qualcomm.com>
